  "title": "CMake: Have the docs target depend on the manpages target",
  "description": "Instead of having the docs target and the manpages target depend\non the same files but not each other, which the Xcode new build\nsystem doesn't allow, have the docs target depend on the manpages\ntarget if it exists.\n\nIf Asciidoctor isn't found, then nothing is added to ${MAN1_INSTALL_FILES}\nand ${MAN4_INSTALL_FILES}, and the manpages target doesn't exist, so\nthis changes nothing but makes Xcode happier.\n\nFix #18590",
